      "releaseNotes": "1、Advanced 3MF Support: You can now view multi-color 3D printing models. The app now recognizes slicer-defined plate layouts and allows you to customize filament colors for each part directly in-app.\n2、Augmented Reality (AR) Mode: Visualize your models in the real world! Use the new AR feature to project and scale your designs in your actual environment.\n3、Optimized Gesture Controls: We’ve refined the interaction engine. Use two-finger gestures to effortlessly pan and zoom for a smoother, more natural navigation experience.\n4、Performance Improvements: Faster loading times for complex assemblies and enhanced rendering stability.",
