      "description": "Powerful 3D Visualization. Absolute Privacy.\nViewer3D is a high-performance, fully offline tool engineered for professionals, designers, and 3D printing enthusiasts. View, inspect, and interact with your models instantly—without cloud uploads or data privacy concerns.\n\nWhy Choose Viewer3D?\n100% Offline & Secure: Your intellectual property never leaves your device. No internet required, no tracking, and zero data collection.\nZero Storage Overhead: Using advanced in-place file access, Viewer3D opens models directly without creating redundant copies, saving your device’s storage.\nIndustry-Grade 3MF Support: Fully compatible with multi-color models and plate layouts from popular 3D printing slicers.\nImmersive AR Experience: Bring your designs into the real world. Visualize models in your physical environment with high-precision Augmented Reality.\n\nKey Features:\nMulti-Color 3MF Management: Seamlessly render multi-part 3MF files. Customize filament colors directly within the app to preview your final print.\nIntuitive Gesture Control: Optimized spatial navigation with fluid two-finger panning and pinch-to-zoom for precise inspection.\nSeamless Integration: Open 3D models instantly via the \"Share\" menu from Files, Mail, or any other app.\n\n\nSupported Formats:\nComprehensive support for STL, PLY, OBJ, 3MF, STEP, and 3DM.\n\n\nWhat’s Next? (Our Roadmap):\nWe are constantly evolving! Upcoming features include:\n• Enhanced STEP Support: Read and manage individual parts/assemblies.\n• Professional Tools: Section views, Material settings, and Exploded views.\n\n\nSupport & Feature Requests: apple@everver.com",
